/T (At 98296 Newfoundland and Labrador Ltd o/a Barrio Legado, we are proud to be an equal opportunity employer that values diversity in our workforce. We firmly believe that a diverse team enhances creativity, innovation, and overall success. Our hiring practices reflect our commitment to inclusivity, as we employ individuals without regard to age, ancestry, color, race, citizenship, ethnic origin, place of origin, creed, disability, family or marital status \(including single status\), gender identity, gender expression, record of offences, sex \(including pregnancy and breastfeeding\), or sexual orientation.)
