/T (After going through the hiring process, we see significant potential in your ability to collaborate effectively with our team and contribute to the growth of our organization. As part of our commitment to ensuring a successful partnership, a 90-day probation period will be implemented in accordance with  Newfoundland and Labrador labour law. This period will provide both parties with the opportunity to assess whether this role is the perfect fit for you. We believe that open communication is key during this time, and we encourage you to share your thoughts and feedback. In the event that either party feels that the fit isn't quite right, we will handle the situation with professionalism and understanding, allowing both of us to move forward without any bias. Should you choose to part ways, we kindly request that you provide us with one week notice to ensure a smooth transition and allow us to fill your role effectively.)
