/T (We strive to accommodate all requests; however, there may be occasions when we need to decline certain requests based on operational requirements. To help us better support your needs and plan accordingly, please ensure that all time off requests are submitted by the Monday of the previous week. For vacation requests, we ask for a minimum notice period of two weeks. The more advance notice you can provide, the easier it will be for management to approve your request and make the necessary arrangements to cover your responsibilities during your absence. Should you have any questions or concerns about the request process or if you need assistance with any specific situation, please do not hesitate to reach out to your Manager. )
