/T (At Barrio Legado, we value punctuality and reliability as key components of our operational success. As an essential member of our team, you are expected to report to work on time for your scheduled shifts. We understand that life can sometimes present unexpected challenges, and if you find yourself running late, we kindly ask that you reach out to the manager on duty as soon as possible. Open communication in these situations is crucial, as it allows us to make necessary adjustments and maintain our high standards of service. We maintain a zero-tolerance policy for no-shows, as they can significantly impact the overall operations of our establishment. Each case of tardiness or absence will be reviewed individually, and we take these matters seriously. Please note that in certain circumstances, such as emergencies, documentation may be required to support your absence. Our commitment to excellent service starts with a dependable team, and we appreciate your efforts in maintaining this standard. )
