/T (At Barrio Legado, we recognize that not all employees feel comfortable addressing incidents or concerns openly within the workplace. To create a safe and supportive environment, we offer various reporting forms tailored to address specific issues, such as violence, harassment, sexual harassment, or health and safety concerns. Employees can choose the report form that best suits their situation. All report forms and an anonymous drop box is situated outside of the office. This allows for a more discreet approach, where employees can submit a report anonymously knowing managers and owners are the only ones with access to these reports to respect your confidentiality.)
