/T (Portable extinguishers are intended to be a first aid measure to cope with a fire of limited size. Before using the fire extinguisher, assess the situation to determine if it is appropriate for effective control.  Once it is determined to be safe to proceed, remember the PASS acronym for free fire extinguisher use.  1.PULL the pin 2.AIM the nozzle at the base of the fire 3.SQUEEZE the handle to release the extinguishing agent 4.SWEEP the nozzle from side to side until the fire is completely out)
