/T (Strict confidentiality is maintained during the investigation of workplace harassment incidents. Employees who become aware of any such incident are required to refrain from disclosing details to third parties without prior consultation with the complainant. Information will only be shared for the purposes of the investigation, legal compliance, or necessary corrective actions. Engaging in gossip about a harassment incident undermines the privacy of all parties involved and will not be tolerated. If you have any questions or concerns about an incident, speak with HR directly.)
/E (Strict confidentiality is maintained during the investigation of workplace harassment incidents. Employees who become aware of any such incident are required to refrain from disclosing details to third parties without prior consultation with the complainant. Information will only be shared for the purposes of the investigation, legal compliance, or necessary corrective actions. Engaging in gossip about a harassment incident undermines the privacy of all parties involved and will not be tolerated. If you have any questions or concerns about an incident, speak with HR directly.)
