/T (Barrio Legado believes in the prevention of violence and promotes a violence-free workplace in which all people respect one another and work together to achieve common goals. Any acts of violence committed by or against any member of our workplace or member of the public is unacceptable conduct that will not be tolerated. We are committed to ensuring our environment is free from violence and will investigate any reported incidents in an objective and timely manner, taking necessary action to respond to those incidents and providing support to the complainant.)
