/Title (At Barrio Legado, we strive to ensure smooth operations while accommodating the varying needs of the restaurant. As part of this effort, employees may be scheduled for on-call shifts, which can fluctuate based on demand and organizational requirements. These shifts will be organized through our scheduling platform, Push Operations, where you can easily view your assignments. However, please note that the specific start and end times of your on-call shifts will be determined by the Manager on Duty, who will make decisions based on real-time business needs. It is your responsibility to proactively reach out to the Manager on Duty at your on call time to confirm whether your presence is needed that day. If the manager assesses that your services are not required, you will not be expected to report to work, providing you with the flexibility to manage your time effectively.)
