/Title (At Barrio Legado, we value the importance of holiday time and understand that our business needs may vary throughout the year. As such, we reserve the right to determine whether we remain open or closed during statutory holidays based on our operational requirements. Should we decide to stay open on a public holiday, employees who are scheduled to work will be expected to fulfill their shifts and will receive premium pay at a rate of 2x their regular hourly wage for the hours they complete.)
/Dest [26 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 4771 0 R
/Next 4785 0 R
>>
