4785 0 obj
<<
/Title (For employees who do not work on a paid public holiday, employees will receive a regular day's pay, provided they have been employed with us for at least 30 days and have completed their scheduled shifts both prior to and following the holiday. To accurately determine the pay for this day, we calculate the employee's average daily earnings by multiplying their hourly rate by the average number of hours worked each day over the three weeks leading up to the holiday. In situations where an employee works fewer hours on a paid public holiday than they would typically be scheduled for, employees will receive their regular pay for the actual hours worked, in addition to a regular day's pay.)
/Dest [26 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 4771 0 R
/Prev 4784 0 R
>>
