<<
/Title (Cell phone usage is prohibited while working on the floor or on the line. It is important that our guests never see you using your phone, as this can detract from their experience and create the impression that we are not fully dedicated to their needs. Cell phone use while working may also lead to potential food safety concerns. If you find yourself in a situation where it's necessary to have your phone on you, please don't hesitate to discuss this with management. We understand that there may be special circumstances or urgent matters that require your attention, and we are here to support you in finding a solution that ensures both your responsibilities and our guests' experiences are prioritized.)
/Dest [28 0 R /Fit]
