4811 0 obj
<<
/Title (At Barrio Legado, we prioritize effective communication and safety in the workplace. To support these goals, we have a policy that prohibits the use of headphones or earphones while working. While we understand that music or podcasts can enhance personal focus for some individuals, it is important to recognize the potential challenges this practice can create in a collaborative workplace. Wearing headphones or earphones can lead to misunderstandings and missed messages, which can have serious implications for our workflow. When employees are unable to hear verbal cues or updates, it can result in errors and disrupt the overall efficiency of our operations. Additionally, the use of headphones or earphones can pose safety concerns. In a bustling workplace, it is crucial that everyone is aware of their surroundings, especially when alarms or urgent announcements are made. By removing distractions such as audio devices, we can create a safer environment where all staff members can respond promptly to critical situations.)
/Dest [29 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 4799 0 R
>>
endobj
