/Title (Mental health disorders continue to be a significant concern in Canada, impacting individuals and organizations alike. The importance of addressing mental health issues cannot be overstated, as failure to do so can lead to serious short-term and long-term consequences. Research shows that employees who face high levels of stress, lack control over their work processes, and do not receive adequate support are at an increased risk for a variety of health problems, including cardiovascular diseases, musculoskeletal disorders, and various mental health issues. In extreme cases, these factors can even contribute to a higher risk of mortality. At Barrio Legado, we believe that fostering a positive workplace culture that prioritizes mental well-being can significantly enhance an organization's dynamics. When employees feel valued and supported, it not only increases their engagement but also elevates their overall productivity. A nurturing work environment promotes open communication and collaboration, empowering teams to excel together.)
/Dest [44 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 5101 0 R
/Next 5111 0 R
>>
endobj
