/Title (If you cannot control the fire: 1.Make sure everyone has exited the building 2.Keep all doors closed 3.Leave the building using the nearest exit 4.Walk quickly but do not run. 5.Assist any disabled persons with exiting 6.Do not go back in the building for any reason until you have been advised to do so by the fire department 7.Meet the fire department at the building entrance to provide them with any updated information. 8.Make sure no one is blocking fire department access.)
